+# [MP8] Gives debug Labels the game's own font.
+# ⚠️ Without it they use the default theme font, **and the letter spacing is broken**. In testing the characters all crushed together into a blob
+# ("P3  id 104..." showed up as "P36idc104..."), and switching to half-width spaces didn't help.
+# The game's own Labels all explicitly use Terminal F4, so we do the same.
+func _mp8_style_debug_label(lbl: Label, color: Color) -> void :
+
+	var f = load("res://fonts/Terminal F4.ttf")
+	if f != null:
