+# and it's what isolated the variable when tracking down the sound issue (the user's idea).
+# Once that was solved it was switched, at the user's request, to info players actually need. **Whether magazine and fire rate are each buffed or nerfed**,
+# **without showing actual numbers** (numbers are the designer's business, players only need the direction). Colors follow the role reveal screen.
+#   Buffed = red   Nerfed = blue   No effect = green
+#
