+func _mp8_show_id_hud() -> void :
+
+	if player_presence == null:
+		return
+
+	# ⚠️ **Both hunters' nodes exist on every machine** (multiplayer syncs all players).
+	# Without this check every screen would have two Labels stacked in the top-right (your own and the other hunter's),
+	# and in testing both windows showed the same person's id — because the one created later covered the earlier one.
+	# This is a first-person HUD and should only appear on the screen of **the hunter you control**.
